r prediction markets and ETF product design, but narrower than the Fed payment-rails decision.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"headline\": \"Ethereum Foundation departures spark fresh debate\",\n      \"source\": \"CoinDesk\",\n      \"importance\": \"medium\",\n      \"reason\": \"Relevant to Ethereum governance/leadership, but less immediately market-wide.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"headline\": \"Trump Media withdrew bitcoin ETF filing\",\n      \"source\": \"CoinDesk\",\n      \"importance\": \"medium\",\n      \"reason\": \"Notable for ETF sentiment, but largely a single filing outcome.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"source_quality\": {\n    \"confidence\": 0.86,\n    \"constraints\": [\n      \"Several alternative sources were unavailable due to fetch restrictions or rate limits.\",\n      \"Assessment is based on currently available live headlines and article detail from CoinDesk.\"\n    ]\n  }\n}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4-mini","usage":{"input":2953,"output":850,"cacheRead":8832,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12635,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779345495756,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DhrKqbLFFjNDJtqAOrrwFEEnt20Nu"}}
